 "description": "Compare 2\u20135 AVnester listings by listingId, side-by-side. Get IDs from search_properties first (not guessable). If the user has more than 5 candidates (\"compare all\"), pick the most relevant 5 (cheapest / largest / best \u20b9/sqft) and say so. Returns each listing plus pricePerSqft, vsCheapestPercent (0 = cheapest), vsLargestAreaPercent (0 = largest). Unknown IDs return not_found_or_unpublished. Does NOT recommend a purchase. Show verification.caveats with verified. Always surface the disclaimer.",
 "execution": {
  "taskSupport": "forbidden"
 },
